' Чего не хватало в проекте: топология была текстом; смешивались HTTP retry, publisher confirms и consumer retry.
' Что сделано: показаны две топологии и DLX/DLQ, TTL 60 s, фактический outbox retry и отсутствующие гарантии 2 s / 3 доставки.
' Ссылки на код:
' services/switch/src/main/java/com/processing/config/RabbitMQConfig.java - очередь журнала, DLX и DLQ
' services/transaction-logger/src/main/java/com/processing/transactionlogger/config/RabbitMQConfig.java - основная очередь журнала и привязка
' services/card-management/src/main/java/com/processing/cardmanagement/config/RabbitMQConfig.java - обменник карточных событий, очереди и DLQ
' services/notification-service/src/main/java/com/processing/notification/config/RabbitMQConfig.java - очередь уведомлений, DLX и DLQ
' services/switch/src/main/java/com/processing/service/LoggerClient.java - отправка операций в RabbitMQ
' services/card-management/src/main/java/com/processing/cardmanagement/services/OutboxEventProcessorImpl.java - отправка событий и повторные попытки
' services/card-management/src/main/resources/application.properties - интервал outbox и число повторов
' services/switch/src/main/resources/application.yml - настройка publisher confirms
' services/notification-service/src/main/resources/application.yml - подключения Notification к БД и RabbitMQ
' services/transaction-logger/src/main/resources/application.yaml - подключения Logger к БД и RabbitMQ
@startuml a5-rabbitmq
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
title А5. RabbitMQ: журнал и карточные события
top to bottom direction
rectangle "Switch\nLoggerClient" as S
rectangle "smp.transactions\n(topic)" as TX
queue "transaction-log\nx-max-delivery=3" as TQ
rectangle "TransactionLogListener\nLogger" as TL
rectangle "smp.transactions.dlx\n(direct)" as DX
queue "transaction-log-dlq\nTTL 60 с" as DQ

database "outbox_event\nPENDING" as OB
rectangle "Card Management\nOutboxEventProcessorImpl" as P
rectangle "smp.card-events\n(topic)" as CX
queue "card-notifications\nx-max-delivery=3" as CQ
rectangle "CardEventListener\nNotification" as CL
rectangle "smp.card-events.dlx\n(direct)" as CDX
queue "card-notifications-dlq\nTTL 60 с" as CDQ

S ..> TX: AMQP async\ntransaction.log
TX ..> TQ: AMQP async\ntransaction.log
TQ ..> TL: AMQP async\nобработка
TQ ..> DX: AMQP async\nreject без requeue
DX ..> DQ: AMQP async\ntransaction-log
OB --> P: JDBC sync\nчтение раз в 1 с
P ..> CX: AMQP async\ncard.<EventClass>
CX ..> CQ: AMQP async\ncard.*
CQ ..> CL: AMQP async\nобработка
CQ ..> CDX: AMQP async\ndead-letter
CDX ..> CDQ: AMQP async\ncard-notifications
@enduml
